 ```
 
+The repeated `-section` form is the Story-scope production gate. It resolves
+each assigned subsection or same-top-level range to the pinned top-level
+section, then requires that binding to have a real production declaration and
+registered executable acceptance case. A scoped run does not infer ownership
+from catalog-row consistency alone; malformed and unpinned assignments fail
